---
/** FINAL CTA — GRIB 공통 도입 상담 배너 */
---

<section class="gcta" aria-label="도입 상담">
  <div class="gcta-in">
    <img class="gcta-bg" src="https://grib-home.vercel.app/img/cta-banner2.svg" alt="" loading="lazy" />
    <div class="gcta-tx">
      <p class="gcta-eb">CONNECT YOUR FIELD</p>
      <h2>우리 현장에 맞는 기술,<br />GRIB과 함께 시작하세요.</h2>
      <p class="gcta-s">산업안전부터 시설·교육·로봇까지,<br />현장 환경과 운영 목적에 맞는 솔루션을 함께 검토합니다.</p>
    </div>
    <a class="gcta-btn" href="#contact">도입 상담하기 <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
  </div>
</section>

<style is:global>.gcta{padding:72px 24px 120px;margin:0;background:#fff;position:relative;z-index:5}.gcta-in{position:relative;max-width:1200px;margin:0 auto;border-radius:36px;overflow:hidden;aspect-ratio:3.1;background:#262d34;box-shadow:0 24px 60px rgba(10,25,60,.18);isolation:isolate}.gcta-bg{position:absolute;top:0;right:6%;width:auto;max-width:none;height:100%;object-fit:cover;object-position:right center;z-index:-2;-webkit-mask-image:linear-gradient(90deg,transparent 0,#000 18%,#000 90%,transparent 100%);mask-image:linear-gradient(90deg,transparent 0,#000 18%,#000 90%,transparent 100%)}.gcta-in:before{content:"";position:absolute;inset:0;z-index:-1;background:linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(22,27,33,.9) 0%,rgba(22,27,33,.6) 38%,rgba(22,27,33,.12) 68%,rgba(22,27,33,0) 100%)}.gcta-tx{position:absolute;left:5%;top:50%;transform:translateY(-50%);color:#fff;max-width:52%;text-align:left}.gcta-eb{margin:0 0 14px;font-size:13px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.14em;color:#7fd8ff}.gcta-tx h2{margin:0 0 16px;font-size:clamp(26px,3.2vw,42px);line-height:1.28;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:-.02em;color:#fff}.gcta-s{margin:0;font-size:clamp(14px,1.25vw,16px);line-height:1.65;color:rgba(255,255,255,.85)}.gcta-btn{position:absolute;right:3.5%;bottom:24%;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;justify-content:center;min-width:200px;padding:16px 42px;border-radius:999px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#6ee7c8 0%,#22d3ee 40%,#3b6dff 100%);color:#06222e;font-weight:700;font-size:16px;text-decoration:none;box-shadow:0 10px 28px rgba(34,120,255,.4);transition:transform .2s}.gcta-btn:hover{transform:translateY(-2px)}@media(max-width:900px){.gcta{margin:0;padding:48px 16px 80px}.gcta-in{aspect-ratio:auto;min-height:460px;border-radius:28px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:flex-end;gap:28px;padding:40px 24px 32px}.gcta-in:before{background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(6,14,34,.25) 0%,rgba(6,14,34,.85) 70%)}.gcta-tx,.gcta-btn{position:static;transform:none;max-width:none}.gcta-btn{align-self:flex-start}.gcta-bg{right:0;width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;object-position:70% center;-webkit-mask-image:none;mask-image:none}}</style>
